Beer City returns to Bishop Ranch with a full day of racing, local brews, and community celebration. The event kicks off with the Beer City Half Marathon, 10K, and 5K, followed by an afternoon festival featuring top East Bay breweries, live music, and local food vendors.
&nbsp;
Guests can also enjoy the fan-favorite Beat the Beast beer mile challenge, explore local taprooms via the Beer City Troll

September marks the prime of grape harvesting in California. To celebrate our local wine makers, join City Center on September 27 at 2:00 PM for exquisite wine sips from Livermore Wineries and culinary treats from participating City Center Restaurants. This ticketed event is sure to sell out.
&nbsp;
Tickets will be available closer to the event!



&nbsp;

Kick off the holiday season at the Kristi Yamaguchi Holiday Ice Rink Opening Ceremony on Friday, November 6, at 6 PM. Enjoy enchanting skating performances, the festive sounds of carolers, and the excitement of Kristi Yamaguchi herself cutting the ribbon to officially open the rink. Glide into the holiday spirit as the ice rink welcomes skaters through January 3.
